From 7d8c197465242f155e653872b3c7cbf88243734b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <assistant@local>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 09:16:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Become a Driver application flow with approval-gated
 registration
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- New DriverApplication model + public /api/applications endpoint (multipart
  form: applicant type, personal info, vehicle/fleet details, service
  interest, ID/licence/disc-cert/photo uploads)
- Admin review endpoints (list/get/approve/reject) issue a one-time
  registration token by email on approval; rejecting sends a reason
- authController.register() now REQUIRES a valid, unused, unexpired
  approval token — email and role are taken from the reviewed application,
  never from client input, and the Driver/Partner record is pre-filled from
  the real submitted data instead of placeholder values
- New public /apply page (matches the danigroup.co.za become_driver.php
  layout/fields) and /register now verifies the token before showing the
  account-setup form
- New admin /applications page: filter by status, review full detail +
  document links, approve/reject with optional reason
- Login page links to /apply for prospective drivers/partners
